 "why_custom_required": "Human lettering is the approved path because every alternative was tested and failed:\n\n- No authoritative Rose/Damascena vector artwork exists. 'Damascena' appears NOWHERE in the searched approved assets - not as live text in 253 vector files, not in a raw byte scan of every .eps/.ai/.pdf/.svg.\n- No complete licensed matching typeface is available. MOXA Bestine and MAREGY Regular are named in the brand guideline but absent from all 4,845 inventoried font files; only incomplete Type1 subsets exist, which carry no licence authority.\n- The reference crop is too coarse for reliable automatic tracing. All thirteen diagnostic glyph reconstructions failed (0.639-0.920 IoU) because the product name is only 40-75 px of cap height and Didone hairlines are 1-2 px there.\n- Available Didone substitutes need distortion or colliding tracking: Bodoni 72 is 1.41x and 1.33x too wide at the measured cap heights, Didot 1.61x and 1.54x.\n- MOXA Bestine is approved brand-typography EVIDENCE but is not confirmed as the concept #97 product-name face.",
